p Program\\nDiscover t\"}}, {\"id\": \"l91\", \"source_doc_id\": \"web-88851fc8d85e155717517ebd\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/about-eha/terms-and-conditions\", \"text\": \"Terms and conditions\", \"source_region\": \"navigation\", \"source_context\": {\"start\": 7368, \"end\": 7548, \"text\": \"ion\\nJobs\\nSponsor EHA\\nContact us\\nFollow us\\nPrivacy statement\\nTerms and conditions\\nSubscribe\\nCopyright © 2026\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\\nEHA Mentorship Program\\nDiscover the rewards of ment\"}}], \"supported_parent_doc_ids\": [], \"source_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-88851fc8d85e155717517ebd\", \"title\": \"HemaSphere - The European Hematology Association (EHA)HemaSphere - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3990, \"end\": 4000, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 10}, {\"start\": 4039, \"end\": 4100, \"excerpt_start\": 11, \"excerpt_end\": 72}, {\"start\": 4192, \"end\": 5721, \"excerpt_start\": 73, \"excerpt_end\": 1602}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"HemaSphere\\nLeft Sidebar\\n3 min read · April 30, 2025\\nApril 30, 2025\\nShare\\nStay at the forefront of cutting-edge research with EHA’s open access, peer-reviewed journal.\\nWith a preliminary 2025 Impact Factor of 11.3, placing it #8 in indexed hematology journals worldwide, HemaSphere is an invaluable resource for hematologists at every career stage.\\nOur continuous online publications support the global hematology community by sharing:\\nResults of high-impact basic, translational, and clinical hematology research\\nInsightful review articles\\nClinical practice guidelines\\nReports of new therapies\\nRecommendations for future research and clinical applications\\nDiscussions on European policy\\nAnd more\\nWe also provide the hematology community with a friction-free route to publishing and publication access through our:\\nFast and constructive review process\\n100% open access content\\nLow publication fees\\nLatest issue\\nExplore this month’s HemaSphere issue, featuring a broad range of hematology papers and insightful discussions on trending topics.\\nHemaSphere podcast\\nListen to the latest HemaSphere podcast and enjoy lighthearted conversations about the research stories behind the publications.\\nThis audio companion to our official journal is available on a range of podcast platforms, and we launch new episodes regularly.\\nCall for novel findings\\nHemaSphere is interested in high-impact studies that share novel findings.\\nIf your study fits this description, please feel free to submit it online for our consideration. HemaSphere does not charge any submission fees.\\nDiscounted publishing fees for EHA membe\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-9e620f66ae71fe39b118f492\", \"title\": \"About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3986, \"end\": 4480, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 494}, {\"start\": 4721, \"end\": 4741, \"excerpt_start\": 495, \"excerpt_end\": 515}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"About EHA\\nMission and vision\\nBoard and committees\\nExecutive Office\\nEuropean affairs\\nCompliance, plans, and reports\\nPartnerships\\nWork at EHA\\nEHA Awards\\nGet involved\\nNews & updates\\n“Borderless Hematology is about giving the best quality of care to all hematology patients.”\\nProf Antonio Almeida, Past EHA President\\nHospital da Luz, Lisbon\\n“Borderless Hematology is about giving the best quality of care to all hematology patients.”\\nProf Antonio Almeida, Past EHA President\\nHospital da Luz, Lisbon\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-9bdd70664e43e95f6f2247c0\", \"title\": \"Topics-in-Focus program - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Topics-in-Focus program - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 4042, \"end\": 4964, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 922}, {\"start\": 5205, \"end\": 5225, \"excerpt_start\": 923, \"excerpt_end\": 943}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"Topics-in-Focus program\\nSupport for a changing world.\\nWith advancements in medical technology and research, there’s never been a more exciting time to be involved in hematology.\\nAs pioneers in our field, our role is to lead the change and find novel ways to incorporate new techniques and therapies into daily practice. We need to rapidly deploy these innovations to fuel our advance towards prevention, a cure, and improved quality of life.\\nOverview\\nEHA launched the Topics-in-Focus program to provide support and guidance to hematologists and amplify efforts by focusing on a specific disease related or area related topics to provide better access to innovation.\\nThe program is designed to:\\nRaise awareness\\nProvide education\\nDevelop further research frameworks and access\\nBuild a network of experts in specific focus areas\\nThe program has two strands, each with a specific theme:\\nPrecision hematology\\nHemoglobinopathies\\nBecome an EHA Mentor\"}], \"local_exploration\": {\"visited_doc_ids\": [\"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"web-740265f7f67c3ce2a194ca41\", \"web-e00b0a496819dad9ea1b68ec\", \"web-b6c9d3593c6121cf0281911b\", \"web-fa499d75bb6176a42b1557b3\", \"web-9e620f66ae71fe39b118f492\", \"web-9bdd70664e43e95f6f2247c0\", \"web-88851fc8d85e155717517ebd\"], \"visited_pages\": [{\"doc_id\": \"web-307533c1a4508473094316ab\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/\", \"title\": \"Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Empowering progress, knowledge, and partnership. - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-f3aba4b966c28f155f997043\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-innovation/grants\", \"title\": \"Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)Grants - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-740265f7f67c3ce2a194ca41\", \"url\": \"https://ehaweb.org/research-