 the community, sharing knowledge, and connecting interests. We advocate for hematology in Europe—and beyond. We seek team members, based in the Netherlands, who are creative, driven to achieve excellence, and inspired by our vision of achieving Borderless Hematology.\\nHead of Education\\nOctober 30, 2026\\nHybrid\\nAre you experienced in CME development and up-to-date with educational programs, and ready to join a vibrant association serving 12.000 members? Join EHA as Head of Education.\\nSee vacancy\\nTemp. Membership Engagement Manager\\nOctober 23, 2026\\nHybrid\\nWorking at the heart of membership engagement? Apply and join EHA as Membership Engagement Manager.\\nSee vacancy\\nEHA Intern – Program Management\\nOctober 21, 2026\\nHybrid\\nAn international internship opportunity where you will support the Senior Program Manager in charge of Congress and Scientific Meetings.\\nSee vacancy\\nEHA Internship – Open Application\\nJuly 12, 2026\\nHybrid\\nAre you looking for an internship opportunity where you make a positive impact to the international Hematology landscape?\\nSee vacancy\\n“At EHA, each voice matters, each idea is valued, and together we strive to transform the landscape of hematology—empowering progress, advancing discovery, and building a future where care knows no borders.”\\nRob\\nHead of Operations\\n“After losing my dad to leukemia in 2024, I felt eager to use my skills and experience to make a meaningful impact for patients, caregivers, and doctors in the field of hematology.\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-88851fc8d85e155717517ebd\", \"title\": \"HemaSphere - The European Hematology Association (EHA)HemaSphere - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3990, \"end\": 4000, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 10}, {\"start\": 4039, \"end\": 4100, \"excerpt_start\": 11, \"excerpt_end\": 72}, {\"start\": 4192, \"end\": 5721, \"excerpt_start\": 73, \"excerpt_end\": 1602}], \"navigation_excerpt\": true, \"text\": \"HemaSphere\\nLeft Sidebar\\n3 min read · April 30, 2025\\nApril 30, 2025\\nShare\\nStay at the forefront of cutting-edge research with EHA’s open access, peer-reviewed journal.\\nWith a preliminary 2025 Impact Factor of 11.3, placing it #8 in indexed hematology journals worldwide, HemaSphere is an invaluable resource for hematologists at every career stage.\\nOur continuous online publications support the global hematology community by sharing:\\nResults of high-impact basic, translational, and clinical hematology research\\nInsightful review articles\\nClinical practice guidelines\\nReports of new therapies\\nRecommendations for future research and clinical applications\\nDiscussions on European policy\\nAnd more\\nWe also provide the hematology community with a friction-free route to publishing and publication access through our:\\nFast and constructive review process\\n100% open access content\\nLow publication fees\\nLatest issue\\nExplore this month’s HemaSphere issue, featuring a broad range of hematology papers and insightful discussions on trending topics.\\nHemaSphere podcast\\nListen to the latest HemaSphere podcast and enjoy lighthearted conversations about the research stories behind the publications.\\nThis audio companion to our official journal is available on a range of podcast platforms, and we launch new episodes regularly.\\nCall for novel findings\\nHemaSphere is interested in high-impact studies that share novel findings.\\nIf your study fits this description, please feel free to submit it online for our consideration. HemaSphere does not charge any submission fees.\\nDiscounted publishing fees for EHA membe\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"web-9e620f66ae71fe39b118f492\", \"title\": \"About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)About EHA - The European Hematology Association (EHA)\", \"source_ranges\": [{\"start\": 3986, \"end\": 4480, \"excerpt_start\": 0, \"excerpt_end\": 494}, {\"start\": 4721, \"end\": 4741, \"excerpt_start\": 495, \"excerpt_end\"